","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_flora_04_13","text":"Centi starts kneading the clay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_flora_04_14","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_flora_04_14","text":"Once she's done, she stacks the coils one after the other, gradually building up the shape of the planter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_flora_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_flora_04_15","text":"Then you smooth the seams together with your fingers...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_flora_04_16","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_flora_04_16","text":"Centi rubs and smooths out the clay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_flora_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_flora_04_17","text":"And just like that, you've got yourself a planter!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_flora_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_flora_04_18","text":"Also, if any cracks form while you're shaping it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_flora_04_19","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_flora_04_19","text":"Centi dips her fingers into some